  "preconditions": [
    "Vehicle array globals are initialized: dword_5C329C holds the slot count, dword_7C54F0 the per-slot pointer array, and each live slot carries a non-zero gate dword at +0x32C8; the driver name string at +0x4714 and the 255-byte path buffer at +0x4794 are writable.",
    "Path globals are initialized before loaders run: dword_7CE5D0 (install root), dword_5EC438/dword_5EC3E0/dword_5EC3D8 (content roots), dword_7CE5EC (settings folder), so AISettingsFileResolver / SettingsFolderResolver / HTreeTerrainFileLoader can assemble paths.",
    "config_list container is initialized (head/tail/iter at +0x1C/+0x20/+0x24, count at +0x28); 0x00433B60 and 0x00433D60 only maintain an existing list and do not create the container.",
    "Session/rule globals valid before 0x00433ED0/0x00433FC0: ScoringGateCheck enabled, dword_8AC394 session-config array present, and byte_7C56C0 holds the shared .hdv/.svm parse state.",
    "net_session object is constructed before 0x0045D890 dispatches; a2 points to a network message whose header bit (v3 & 0xE0000000) == 0x80000000 selects the dispatch switch.",
    "0x0044C4C0 requires `this` to be a built spatial_grid (min/scale doubles at +0x08..+0x20, cell-pointer array at +0x28) and a2 to carry an X/Z double position (+0x00/+0x10) and a query-occupant slot at +0x30."
  ],
  "postconditions": [
    "0x004333E0 assigns every live slot's AI settings path into +0x4794 (via sub_587DD0, 255 cap) and clears the +0x4893 byte, after probing .svm/.ai candidate files through the settings folder.",
    "0x00433B60 appends a new 28-byte vehicle_config_entry (destroy-flag 1 wrapped in a linked_list_cell) to config_list, sets entry +0x10 to the current iteration id and increments the +0x28 count; it returns 0 on success, 1 when a matching entry already exists.",
    "0x00433D60 unlinks and frees every entry whose +0x14 name equals the argument (running the cell's +0x08 destroy flag to free the payload), fixes head/tail/iter and decrements +0x28.",
    "0x004562F0 / 0x004572B0 / 0x004585E0 fill their emitter/light/particle config objects (float band +0x30..+0x5C, flags +0x64..+0x78, activation +0x7C..+0x88, radius +0x88, plus position/orientation vectors at +0x00/+0x0C) from a token stream; they return 1 at token-stream end (v4==4) and 0 on the failure/zero-default path (v4==2 or flag exhaustion).",
    "0x0044F5F0 hides the cursor, destroys and nulls all six cursor handles at +0x30..+0x94 (stride 0x14), and zeroes +0xA8.",
    "0x0045D890 handles the network message by type and returns 1 for every recognized type (2,3,4,5,6,0x20,0x23,0x24,0x27,0x28,0x29,0x2A); unrecognized headers fall through to the legacy path and return 0 unless matched against session type dword_7C56A4.",
    "0x0045ECD0 empties the net_session pending-chat list at +0x1B780 (freeing payloads), then re-broadcasts up to 10 autochat messages through the audio stream; the 0x1B770 chat list and +0x1B780 pending list are both managed as linked_list_cell chains."
  ],
  "side_effects": [
    "File I/O: 0x004333E0 / 0x004336F0 probe and open .svm/.ai settings files (sub_587DB0, FileCloseWithLock); 0x0044C0E0 opens .hat terrain files, queries the registry for path precedence and creates output directories (CreateDirectoryAWrapper); 0x0045C0C0 enumerates a directory into a file_list.",
    "Heap churn: OperatorNewNhMallocWrapper / FreeWrapper_7bcf for 28-byte vehicle_config_entry + 12-byte linked_list_cell nodes (0x00433B60/0x00433D60), 12-byte file-list entries (0x0045C0C0), chat nodes (0x0045D890/0x0045ECD0) and 208-byte camera objects (0x004348B0).",
    "Shared string-registry mutations: StringCopyWithBufferRealloc writes into the byte_5EA438-backed registry; 0x00455290 copies ~44 input-action name literals into it (gear/clutch/steer/LCD/pit-action names); the exact destination buffer is not visible in the raw C.",
    "Windows resource teardown: 0x0044F5F0 calls SetCursor/DestroyCursor on the six cached HCURSOR handles.",
    "Audio: 0x00448140 builds the 'Ambient\\helicopter.wav' path and configures a 3D-sound object via vtable+0x5C; 0x0045ECD0 opens a Miles audio stream (AudioStreamOpen) for the autochat broadcast.",
    "Global state transitions: byte_8AFF00 set by 0x0045D890 on grid/ready; dword_83EE54 session-message ring advanced under dword_7D2E50 in the legacy path; byte_7C56C0 .hdv parse buffer and dword_7C56C4 reset by 0x00433ED0; byte_7C56C0 re-initialized by 0x00433EB0.",
    "Network session updates: 0x0045D890 writes grid arrays (flt_5F0774..flt_7C9574, 4656-byte stride), marks self-ready (NetComm_SetSelfAsReady), appends chat/removal messages to +0x1B770 and enqueues pending items to +0x1B780.",
    "Constructor side effects: 0x004571E0 sets transform_3d_object +0x70 (type discriminator) to 1 and its derived 0x004583B0 to 2; vtables installed at +0x00 (off_59EFAC for sound_emitter, off_59EFEC for transform base, off_59F00C for the 3D object override)."
  ],
